OL,3,AOne of James Bulger's killers to remain
OL,4,Ain prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA summary of the panel's findings said:
OL,7,F"At the outset of the hearing, Mr
OL,8,FVenables submitted an opening statement
OL,9,Fto the effect that he accepted the need
OL,10,Fto undertake further offending work in
OL,11,Fcustody and so was not seeking
OL,12,Frelease."
